CROSS-LAYER AVAILABILITY METRICS

For every G5 release
in 5:3 worlds record:

release epoch;

former side;

whether the cell is
within radius 3
of a challenged favored veteran
at recruitment time;

Q_favored_ch_occ;

Q_adverse_ch_occ;

whether it is recruited
